    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

These are measurements of how physical devices behave. Facts are not
copyrightable, and asserting a licence over them would imply an ownership that
does not exist. CC0 states plainly that no such claim is being made.

A citation is welcome. It is not a condition.
